 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? There are a few key tricks. One, get it listed everywhere so people find it easily. Two, release it in chunks so people feel a sense of accomplishment. Three, keep your intro brief so people listen before dropping off. Sure, it's about podcasts. Fair enough. Email it out, post it on forums, even whisper in earshot in the supermarket. Yes, it does. A weekly release gives people a schedule to work towards. Start with just the first episode and say how the full series is coming. People love an exciting adventure.",
